      "previousEnglishMeaning": "An impact breaks connections and physical pieces move. Collisions and breakage also generate chips and dust. Trigger effects appropriate to the material. Large pieces and small effects communicate the impact together. Watch the large panel fall as dust spreads from the same location. Physical fragments change the shape; particles fill out the impression of a break."
